{"text":{"en":{"\n        <svg class=\"logo-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"17\" stroke=\"#c98a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"8.5\" stroke=\"#4f7fb3\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"7\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"33\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"company-name\">\n          [회사명] 베어링\n          <span class=\"sub\">BEARING DISTRIBUTION</span>\n        </span>\n      ":"\n        <svg class=\"logo-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"17\" stroke=\"#c98a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"8.5\" stroke=\"#4f7fb3\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"7\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"33\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"company-name\">\n          [Company Name] Bearing\n          <span class=\"sub\">BEARING DISTRIBUTION</span>\n        </span>\n      ","회사소개":"Company","\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#greeting\">인사말</a>\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#history\">연혁</a>\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#directions\">찾아오시는 길</a>\n          ":"\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#greeting\">Greeting</a>\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#history\">History</a>\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#directions\">Directions</a>\n          ","취급제품":"Products","\n            <a href=\"about-product.html#bearing-group\">베어링</a>\n            <a href=\"about-product.html#accessory-group\">부속 부품</a>\n            <a href=\"brands.html\">취급 브랜드</a>\n          ":"\n            <a href=\"about-product.html#bearing-group\">Bearings</a>\n            <a href=\"about-product.html#accessory-group\">Accessory Parts</a>\n            <a href=\"brands.html\">Brands</a>\n          ","규격검색":"Spec Search","고객센터":"Support","\n            <a href=\"notice.html\">공지사항</a>\n            <a href=\"catalog.html\">카탈로그</a>\n            <a href=\"board.html\">견적문의</a>\n          ":"\n            <a href=\"notice.html\">Notices</a>\n            <a href=\"catalog.html\">Catalog</a>\n            <a href=\"board.html\">Quote Inquiry</a>\n          ","\n          <a href=\"board.html\" class=\"btn btn-accent btn-sm\">견적 문의하기</a>\n        ":"\n          <a href=\"board.html\" class=\"btn btn-accent btn-sm\">Request a Quote</a>\n        ","\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Plastic Bearing Units · F Series</p>\n        <h2>플라스틱 베어링 유닛 F 시리즈 (사각 플랜지형 4홀)</h2>\n        <p>하우징을 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">엔지니어링 플라스틱(폴리에틸렌 등)</strong>으로 제작한, 볼트 구멍 4개(사각) 플랜지로 벽면·수직면에 고정하는 유닛입니다. 주철(일반 UCF) 대비 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">무자성·내식성·경량</strong>이 장점입니다.</p>\n        <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>\n      ":"\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Plastic Bearing Units · F Series</p>\n        <h2>Plastic Bearing Unit F Series (Square Flange, 4-Hole)</h2>\n        <p>A unit with a housing made of <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">engineering plastic (polyethylene, etc.)</strong>, mounted to a wall or vertical surface with a 4-hole (square) flange. Compared to cast iron (standard UCF), its advantages are <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">non-magnetic, corrosion-resistant, and lightweight</strong> properties.</p>\n        <p class=\"section-head-tip\">You can search by entering just part of the model number or dimensions.</p>\n      ","\n          <p class=\"diagram-caption\">형태 참고용 도면 — 표준 UCF 사각 4홀 플랜지와 동일한 하우징 구조이며, 재질만 엔지니어링 플라스틱입니다.</p>\n          <img src=\"img/flu_diagram.png\" alt=\"사각 플랜지형 4홀(F) 구조 단면도\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <p class=\"diagram-legend\">아래 표의 d(축경)·L(사각변)·J(볼트간격)·A1(베이스두께)·A(플랜지두께)·N(볼트구멍지름)·T(슬리브폭)·B(베어링폭)·S1(볼트구멍폭)에 해당합니다. 도면 기호는 원 출처 표기로, 아래 표 기호와 1:1로 대응하지 않을 수 있습니다.</p>\n        ":"\n          <p class=\"diagram-caption\">Reference drawing for shape only — identical housing structure to a standard UCF square 4-hole flange, with only the material being engineering plastic.</p>\n          <img src=\"img/flu_diagram.png\" alt=\"Square flange type 4-hole (F) structural cross-section diagram\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <p class=\"diagram-legend\">Corresponds to d (bore), L (square side), J (bolt spacing), A1 (base thickness), A (flange thickness), N (bolt hole diameter), T (sleeve width), B (bearing width), and S1 (bolt hole width) in the table below. The diagram symbols follow the original source notation and may not correspond 1:1 with the symbols in the table below.</p>\n        ","\n          <label for=\"fFilter\">형번 / 축경 검색</label>\n          <input id=\"fFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: F204 또는 20\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n        ":"\n          <label for=\"fFilter\">Search by Model / Bore</label>\n          <input id=\"fFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. F204 or 20\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n        ","형번":"Model No.","축경(d)":"Bore (d)","사각변(L)":"Square Side (L)","볼트간격(J)":"Bolt Spacing (J)","베이스두께(A1)":"Base Thickness (A1)","플랜지두께(A)":"Flange Thickness (A)","볼트구멍지름(N)":"Bolt Hole Diameter (N)","슬리브폭(T)":"Sleeve Width (T)","베어링폭(B)":"Bearing Width (B)","볼트구멍폭(S1)":"Bolt Hole Width (S1)","중량(kg)":"Weight (kg)","단위: mm":"Unit: mm","\n        ※ 위 표는 당사 SWS 카탈로그에 치수 자료가 없어, 해외 제조사·유통사의 공개 자료(Miniature Bearings Australia의 P204PE·P205PE·P206PE 제품 페이지, MOVET의 PPL 플라스틱 하우징 공식 데이터시트, Felstrom의 플라스틱 하우징 유닛(UCF2..PSS·UCFL2..PSS) 공식 데이터시트, 표준 UC200계열 인서트 베어링 치수)를 기준으로 작성했습니다. 확인하지 못한 치수는 추정하지 않고 “문의”로 표기했습니다. 정밀 가공·발주 전에는 반드시 견적 문의로 최종 치수를 확인하시기 바랍니다.\n      ":"\n        * The table above was prepared based on published data from overseas manufacturers/distributors (the Miniature Bearings Australia product pages for P204PE·P205PE·P206PE, MOVET’s official datasheet for PPL plastic housings, Felstrom’s official datasheet for plastic housing units (UCF2..PSS·UCFL2..PSS), and standard UC200 series insert bearing dimensions), since our SWS catalog has no dimension data for these. Dimensions we could not confirm are marked “Inquire” rather than estimated. Before precision machining or ordering, please always confirm final dimensions via a quote inquiry.\n      ","<a href=\"plastic_unit.html\" style=\"color: var(--accent);\">← 플라스틱 베어링 유닛 전체 목록으로</a>":"<a href=\"plastic_unit.html\" style=\"color: var(--accent);\">← Back to All Plastic Bearing Units</a>","F 시리즈(사각 플랜지형 4홀) | [회사명] 베어링":"F Series (Square Flange, 4 Holes) | [Company Name] Bearing"},"ja":{"\n        <svg class=\"logo-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"17\" stroke=\"#c98a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"8.5\" stroke=\"#4f7fb3\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"7\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"33\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"company-name\">\n          [회사명] 베어링\n          <span class=\"sub\">BEARING DISTRIBUTION</span>\n        </span>\n      ":"\n        <svg class=\"logo-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"17\" stroke=\"#c98a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"8.5\" stroke=\"#4f7fb3\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"7\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"33\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"company-name\">\n          [会社名] ベアリング\n          <span class=\"sub\">ベアリング販売</span>\n        </span>\n      ","회사소개":"会社紹介","\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#greeting\">인사말</a>\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#history\">연혁</a>\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#directions\">찾아오시는 길</a>\n          ":"\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#greeting\">ごあいさつ</a>\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#history\">沿革</a>\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#directions\">アクセス</a>\n          ","취급제품":"取扱製品","\n            <a href=\"about-product.html#bearing-group\">베어링</a>\n            <a href=\"about-product.html#accessory-group\">부속 부품</a>\n            <a href=\"brands.html\">취급 브랜드</a>\n          ":"\n            <a href=\"about-product.html#bearing-group\">ベアリング</a>\n            <a href=\"about-product.html#accessory-group\">付属部品</a>\n            <a href=\"brands.html\">取扱ブランド</a>\n          ","규격검색":"規格検索","고객센터":"カスタマーセンター","\n            <a href=\"notice.html\">공지사항</a>\n            <a href=\"catalog.html\">카탈로그</a>\n            <a href=\"board.html\">견적문의</a>\n          ":"\n            <a href=\"notice.html\">お知らせ</a>\n            <a href=\"catalog.html\">カタログ</a>\n            <a href=\"board.html\">お見積り依頼</a>\n          ","\n          <a href=\"board.html\" class=\"btn btn-accent btn-sm\">견적 문의하기</a>\n        ":"\n          <a href=\"board.html\" class=\"btn btn-accent btn-sm\">お見積り依頼する</a>\n        ","\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Plastic Bearing Units · F Series</p>\n        <h2>플라스틱 베어링 유닛 F 시리즈 (사각 플랜지형 4홀)</h2>\n        <p>하우징을 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">엔지니어링 플라스틱(폴리에틸렌 등)</strong>으로 제작한, 볼트 구멍 4개(사각) 플랜지로 벽면·수직면에 고정하는 유닛입니다. 주철(일반 UCF) 대비 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">무자성·내식성·경량</strong>이 장점입니다.</p>\n        <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>\n      ":"\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Plastic Bearing Units · F Series</p>\n        <h2>プラスチックベアリングユニット Fシリーズ (角フランジ形4ホール)</h2>\n        <p>ハウジングを<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">エンジニアリングプラスチック(ポリエチレンなど)</strong>で製作した、ボルト穴4個(角形)のフランジで壁面・垂直面に固定するユニットです。鋳鉄(一般UCF)に比べて<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">無磁性・耐食性・軽量</strong>が長所です。</p>\n        <p class=\"section-head-tip\">型番または寸法の一部だけ入力しても検索できます。</p>\n      ","\n          <p class=\"diagram-caption\">형태 참고용 도면 — 표준 UCF 사각 4홀 플랜지와 동일한 하우징 구조이며, 재질만 엔지니어링 플라스틱입니다.</p>\n          <img src=\"img/flu_diagram.png\" alt=\"사각 플랜지형 4홀(F) 구조 단면도\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <p class=\"diagram-legend\">아래 표의 d(축경)·L(사각변)·J(볼트간격)·A1(베이스두께)·A(플랜지두께)·N(볼트구멍지름)·T(슬리브폭)·B(베어링폭)·S1(볼트구멍폭)에 해당합니다. 도면 기호는 원 출처 표기로, 아래 표 기호와 1:1로 대응하지 않을 수 있습니다.</p>\n        ":"\n          <p class=\"diagram-caption\">形状参考用図面 — 標準UCF角形4ホールフランジと同一のハウジング構造で、材質のみエンジニアリングプラスチックです。</p>\n          <img src=\"img/flu_diagram.png\" alt=\"角フランジ形4ホール(F)構造断面図\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <p class=\"diagram-legend\">下表のd(軸径)・L(角辺)・J(ボルト間隔)・A1(ベース厚さ)・A(フランジ厚さ)・N(ボルト穴径)・T(スリーブ幅)・B(ベアリング幅)・S1(ボルト穴幅)に該当します。図面記号は原典の表記であり、下表の記号と1:1で対応しない場合があります。</p>\n        ","\n          <label for=\"fFilter\">형번 / 축경 검색</label>\n          <input id=\"fFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: F204 또는 20\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n        ":"\n          <label for=\"fFilter\">型番 / 軸径検索</label>\n          <input id=\"fFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"例: F204 または 20\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n        ","형번":"形番","축경(d)":"軸径(d)","사각변(L)":"角辺(L)","볼트간격(J)":"ボルト間隔(J)","베이스두께(A1)":"ベース厚さ(A1)","플랜지두께(A)":"フランジ厚さ(A)","볼트구멍지름(N)":"ボルト穴径(N)","슬리브폭(T)":"スリーブ幅(T)","베어링폭(B)":"ベアリング幅(B)","볼트구멍폭(S1)":"ボルト穴幅(S1)","중량(kg)":"重量(kg)","단위: mm":"単位: mm","\n        ※ 위 표는 당사 SWS 카탈로그에 치수 자료가 없어, 해외 제조사·유통사의 공개 자료(Miniature Bearings Australia의 P204PE·P205PE·P206PE 제품 페이지, MOVET의 PPL 플라스틱 하우징 공식 데이터시트, Felstrom의 플라스틱 하우징 유닛(UCF2..PSS·UCFL2..PSS) 공식 데이터시트, 표준 UC200계열 인서트 베어링 치수)를 기준으로 작성했습니다. 확인하지 못한 치수는 추정하지 않고 “문의”로 표기했습니다. 정밀 가공·발주 전에는 반드시 견적 문의로 최종 치수를 확인하시기 바랍니다.\n      ":"\n        ※上記の表は、当社SWSカタログに寸法資料がないため、海外メーカー・流通業者の公開資料(Miniature Bearings AustraliaのP204PE・P205PE・P206PE製品ページ、MOVETのPPLプラスチックハウジング公式データシート、Felstromのプラスチックハウジングユニット(UCF2..PSS・UCFL2..PSS)公式データシート、標準UC200シリーズインサートベアリング寸法)を基準に作成しました。確認できなかった寸法は推定せず「お問い合わせ」と表記しました。精密加工・発注前には必ずお見積り依頼で最終寸法をご確認ください。\n      ","<a href=\"plastic_unit.html\" style=\"color: var(--accent);\">← 플라스틱 베어링 유닛 전체 목록으로</a>":"<a href=\"plastic_unit.html\" style=\"color: var(--accent);\">← プラスチックベアリングユニット一覧へ</a>","F 시리즈(사각 플랜지형 4홀) | [회사명] 베어링":"Fシリーズ（角フランジ形 4穴） | [会社名] ベアリング"},"zh":{"\n        <svg class=\"logo-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"17\" stroke=\"#c98a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"8.5\" stroke=\"#4f7fb3\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"7\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"33\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"company-name\">\n          [회사명] 베어링\n          <span class=\"sub\">BEARING DISTRIBUTION</span>\n        </span>\n      ":"\n        <svg class=\"logo-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"17\" stroke=\"#c98a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"8.5\" stroke=\"#4f7fb3\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"7\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"33\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n        </svg>